{"hw":"ἀμφιπολέω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀμφιπολέω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀμφιπολ-έω</span>, later form of <span class=\"gk\">ἀμφιπολεύω,</span> mostly in <span class=\"lex-gram\">pres.</span> (<span class=\"lex-gram\">aor. 1</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">N.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.6</span> </span>):—<div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">attend constantly,</b> <span class=\"gk\">ἤδη με γηραιὸν μέρος ἁλικίας ἀ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.158</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">attend on, watch, guard,</b> <span class=\"gk\">Ἱμέραν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">O.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">12.2</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Theoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.124</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">λέκτρον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">N.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.6</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">busy oneself with,</b> <span class=\"gk\">μυρία φρενί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">B.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.3</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">3</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">tend, treat gently,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τρώμαν ἕλκεος</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pi.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">P.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.271</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> c. dat., <b class=\"lex-tr\">roam with, accompany,</b> <span class=\"gk\">θεαῖς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">OC</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">680</span> </span> (lyr.).</div></div>"}